{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/deckbuild_placeholder.gif?t=1746404795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your pouch with the right talismans and banners\u2014these will be crucial for harnessing the power of Yokai Cores. Choose wisely, as your survival depends on it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/momentumV2.gif?t=1746404795\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gain Momentum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use poles and abilities to build momentum, reach incredible speeds, and unlock the true power of motion. The faster you go, the stronger you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/attack.gif?t=1746404795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush enemies with the raw energy of Yokai Cores! Maintain your speed and positioning while letting your cores fight for you\u2014unleashing devastating autonomous attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/levelup.gif?t=1746404795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and merge your Yokai-infused talismans. Strengthen them further by embedding powerful banners into their very fabric, enhancing your combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/combination.gif?t=1746404795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse different abilities to reshape your gameplay! Sacrifice one skill to create a legendary enhanced ability\u2014turning the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/pack_upgrade.gif?t=1746404795\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/pack1__3-4___1_.gif?t=1746404795\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/pack1__5-6___1_.gif?t=1746404795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Buy a Talisman and Banner Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open new talisman and banner packs to transform your playstyle. Experiment with fresh builds and break through enemies you couldn\u2019t defeat before!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>End More</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More pole type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momentum Challenges</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618900?t=1746404795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/f7dc222ee9f418f2770ab4e2024091f52e606474/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746404795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/54efe38f8d0f0ebb5e3a24cda1ee7a2225871da2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746404795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/54efe38f8d0f0ebb5e3a24cda1ee7a2225871da2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746404795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=